Description: Tools for generation and statistical analysis of Central 
    Composite Designs (CCD). The package allows experimental matrix 
    generation, matrix export, model fitting, ANOVA, estimation of 
    effects and coefficients, response surface visualization, contour 
    plots, Pareto charts, consolidated analytical summaries and 
    automated report export. Designed for researchers, students and 
    professionals working with experimental design and process 
    optimization.
